    rdfs:label "Areni";
    rdfs:comment "The so-called \"Areni-1 cave complex\" is an archaeological site located near the Areni village in southern Armenia along the Arpa River. The site shows evidence for both ritual and occupational activity in the late Chalcolithic to Early Bronze Age.";
