<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/3026205%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Fingrinhoe Roman Site";
    rdfs:comment "A multi-acre site, now located within the bounds of the Fingringhoe Wick Nature Discovery Park in Colchester. The site may have been or included a Roman military supply base that was in use until ca. A.D. 120. The site included several structures, a ditched enclosure, and a possible villa.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/3026205> .

