<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/30635483%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Costia dei Lippi";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/403291%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "The archaeological area of Costia dei Lippi is located near the contemporary cemetery of Vetulonia. Excavations in this area began in the 1960s and revealed a series of stone walls built in a squared technique, as well as a system of terraces and a paved road. The area has been interpreted as a domestic quarter dating ca. the third to the first century BCE.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/30635483> .

