    rdfs:comment "The mastaba-style tomb of Ptahshepses, vizier to the Fifth Dynasty Pharaoh Nyuserre Ini. Following the intial elite burials in the Old Kingdom, the mastaba became a funerary site for new burials during the Late Period.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/309640805> .

