<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/315151%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Siagu";
    rdfs:comment "An ancient settlement in the Roman province of Africa Proconsularis. It was located at a site known today as Ksar el-Zit, which is in the vicinity of Bir Bou Rekba to the northwest of Hammamet, Tunisia.";
