    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/705921778%23this>,
        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/991345%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "A Roman senatorial estate located southwest of ancient Sufes, epigraphically attested in the second century CE, and owned at least for a period by the otherwise unknown senator Lucilius Africanus. Its location and extent is thought to have corresponding roughly to the later, late-antique province of Byzacena.";
