    rdfs:label "Pini di Sirolo";
    rdfs:comment "\"I Pini di Sirolo\" is the name given to the archaeological site of a Picene necropolis of the first millennium BCE in Italy's Marche region. The necropolis included a large tumulus of the sixth century BCE that included two chariots.";
