<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/327866939%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Abbey of Santissima Trinità, Venosa";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/799968313%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "The Abbey of Santissima Trinità at Venosa was a Roman Catholic abbey that exhibits numerous architectural influences. Its remains now lie within the archaeological park of Venosa. The complex includes several principal parts in addition to the church, including monastery buildings and the so-called \"Incompiuta\", a church project of the eleventh century that was begun but never completed.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/327866939> .

