<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/337124895%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Investiture relief of Ardashir I";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/410216617%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "A rock-cut relief depicting the investiture of Ardashir I, ca. A.D. 226-242. This relief is the earliest Sasanian monument at Naqš-e Rustam.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/337124895> .

