    rdfs:comment "A bath complex adjacent to Pompeii's forum that was built after 80 BC (Reg VII, Ins 5, 2, 5, 7, 24). The baths are publicly financed by the duovir Lucius Caesius and the aediles Caius Occius and Lucius Niraemius.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/338820566> .

