<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/339319311%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Hayling Island Saxon Settlement";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/79504%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "Between ca. 570-900 CE (radio-carbon dates), a Saxon-era settlement and possible ritual site flourished on and around the location of an earlier Iron-Age/Roman sanctuary in the northern part of modern Hayling Island (borough of Havant, Hampshire, England).";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/339319311> .

