    rdfs:label "Sepolcro dei Veienti";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/963165127%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "The so-called \"Sepolcro dei Veienti\" is a ruined tomb of Roman imperial date. Built in opus caementicium and travertine, only the core of the rectangular structure remains. Likely located along the ancient Via Veientana, the tomb today stands in the modern Parco Papacci.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/344023792> .

