    rdfs:label "Qasr Shemamok";
    rdfs:comment "A tell located some 30 kilometers south of Erbil in Iraq's Kurdistan Region. Occupation at the site began in the second millennium BCE and continued through Parthian and Sassanian phases.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/349652621> .

