    rdfs:comment "Intramural amphitheater located within the military sector on the north side of Dura-Europos. Built on the site of the former Bath F3, which was destroyed by fire. The amphitheater's dedication in 216 CE is attested by an inscription found fallen from above entrance C on the south side of the amphitheater.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/356665990> .

