<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/370240026%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Arch of Septimius Severus";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/502866838%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "The Arch of Septimius Severus is situated at the northwest corner of the Forum Romanum. It was dedicated in A.D. 203 and serves to commemorate the Parthian victories of Emperor Septimius Severus and his two sons against the Parthians (194/195 and 197–199).";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/370240026> .

