    rdfs:label "Villa of Good Fortune";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/491678%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "A well-appointed \"villa\" at Olynthus excavated in 1934, the so-called \"Villa of Good Fortune\" was considered one of the two \"type\" houses for the ancient site. It was located in the southeastern part of the city in the so-called \"villa quarter\". Its remains are no longer visible.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/37482810> .

