    rdfs:label "Temple of Victory";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/462244%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "A Greek temple of the Doric order (peripteral hexastyle), built in the fifth century BC, possibly to celebrate a victory against the Carthaginians. Its ruins are still visible in the archaeological site of Himera.";
