<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/377313804%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Teniky";
    rdfs:comment "An archaeological site in the modern Parc National de l'Isalo in southern Madagascar. The site comprises rock-cut terraces, niches, walls, and other features in a style unique in the region. Radiocarbon dating of charcoal and stylistic dating of imported ceramics place activity at the site to a period spanning the 10th - 12th centuries CE. The excavators tentatively interpret the site as part of a former necropolis made by settlers with Zoroastrian origins.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/377313804> .

<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/377313804/imagery-location-representative-point-for-teniky-site> dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/thomase>;
