<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/383677%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Industria/Bodincomagum?";
    rdfs:comment "Industria/Bodincomagum? (Monteu da Po) was a Ligurian settlement in the Po valley. Under Roman influence, the site became known as Industria, a colonial establishment, in regio IX of the Augustan organization of Italy. The colony is likely founded ca. 124 B.C.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/383677> .

