<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/383712%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Monte Barro";
    rdfs:comment "Archaeological fieldwork conducted on Monte Barro between 1986 and 1997 produced important data related to the early Middle Ages in northern Italy. A settlement with a military nature develops from the fifth century CE onward. Of particular interest is a structure dubbed \"Grande edificio\", interpreted as the likely residence of a public official.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/383712> .

