<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/386554382/name.2018-01-16.9133865987> dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/jnovotny>;
    dcterms:description "The Akkadian ceremonial name of the Šamaš Gate means \"O Šamaš, Make Firm the Foundation(s) of the Troops!.\" This name is mentioned in Tablet V of the series Tintir = Babylon.";
    dcterms:modified "2021-01-28T12:32:26-04:00";
    dcterms:subject "ANE";
    dcterms:title "Šamaš-išid-ummāni-kīn";
    owl:sameAs <http://pleiades.stoa.org/places/386554382/name.2018-01-16.9133865987> .

<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/386554382/proposed-location-of-the-samas-gate> dcterms:creator <https://pleiades.stoa.org/author/jnovotny>;
    dcterms:description "The proposed location of the Šamaš Gate is based on a plan of the ruins of eastern Babylon, with 200 m UTM coordinates.";
