    rdfs:label "Assur Archive 47";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/893945%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "In a private house in fC8I, excavators discovered a small archive of 7 clay tablets. Available datings range from 762 to postcanonical 622* BC. The archive, belonging to a family of tanners, consists of purchase documents, a juridical settlement, and two documents concerning inheritance.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/387051092> .

