<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/304296863%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "So-called Area X in Berenike";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/373757%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "The ruins of a small building (possibly first century AD) with a shrine, in the archaeological site of Sidi Khiribech, in Berenike. According to some archaeologists, it might have been connected to the adjacent Area A, and constituted together a single unit. In other interpretations, it is an independent sacred space.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/304296863> .

