    rdfs:comment "An ancient settlement located in the modern Soummam river valley at a place called Tiklat, which is near modern El Kseur in Algeria's Kabylia province. Here the Roman emperor Augustus established a veteran colony. Bishops of Tubusuctu are attested in the fifth century CE.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/305171> .

