<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/305199887%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "So-called Roman Baths in Apollonia";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/373732%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "An architectural complex near the sea in Apollonia. It went through different stages and alterations between, roughly, the fourth century B.C. and the seventh century A.D. It was probably used as a private villa, then as public baths and, perhaps, as cisterns in later years.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/305199887> .

