    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/328428%23this>,
        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/83003523%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "Hadrumetum/Iustinianopolis was an important ancient port in North Africa. Founded by the Phoenicians, the site pre-dated Carthage. Under Roman administration, the site prospered, and Trajan assigned it colonial status as Colonia Concordia Ulpia Trajana Augusta Frugifera Hadrumetina.";
