        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/vocabularies/sanctuary>;
    pleiades:hasLocation <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/kothon> .

<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/38626420> a <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept>,
