<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/344386%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Henchir el Khaway";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/344440%23this>,
        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/349597%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "Henchir el Khaway is located on the southwest coast of the island of Djerba, in the northwest outskirts of modern Tunisian village of Guellala. The settlement here was founded at least as early as the fifth century BCE. Its longevity and development are attested by archaeological evidence (both terrestrial and maritime/submerged) dating well into late antiquity.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/344386> .

<https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/344390%23this> a <http://geovocab.org/spatial#Feature>;
    rdfs:label "Henchir Bourgou";
    spatial:C <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/349597%23this>,
        <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/349640%23this>;
    rdfs:comment "An ancient settlement located in the east-central portion of the modern Tunisian island of Djerba, northwest of the modern town of Midoun. Archaeological evidence indicates habitation beginning in the 8th century BCE and continuing through the 2nd century CE.";
    foaf:isPrimaryTopicOf <https://pleiades.stoa.org/places/344390> .

