    dcterms:coverage "TUN";
    dcterms:creator <http://viaf.org/viaf/89088748>;
    dcterms:description "Ptolemy lists this city (polis) first in a list \"between the two Syrtis's\". Some scholars have tentatively identified it with Zouchis (i.e., Taricheiai), attested in Strabo and Stephanus, and with Chouchis, attested in a fragment of Artemidorus of Ephesus. Mattingly (BAtlas) was unwilling to accept the equivalence, listing Chouzis as \"unlocated\", a decision followed here.";
